  "name": "Darkflock is an 8 second caster aura, not a channel, and keeps ticking while other abilities are cast",
  "contract": [
    "Darkflock (ranks 520270, 520708, 520709, 562024, 562025) was a channel until Ascension reworked it: the CoA",
    "client Spell.dbc row has no channel bit (AttributesEx 0, previously 4) and its tooltip changed from 'Channel for",
    "$d, commanding a flock of crows ...' to 'For $d, command a flock of crows to deal ... to enemies in front of you",
    "every $t1 sec.' #8428 forced the channel bit back from the older tooltip. Expected: casting Darkflock starts no",
    "cast or channel timer and puts an 8 s Darkflock aura on the Witch Hunter; Shadowblast cast during it leaves the",
    "aura in place and 520271 keeps hitting; the aura runs out after 8 s with 3-4 ticks in total. Rank 1 (520270, the",
    "id the in-game bug form reports) also casts as an 8 s aura with no channel. Do not restore the channel from older",
    "tooltips, footage or guides: check the current client Spell.dbc row first."
  ],
